{"id":"wb-7-701","name":"小洪纳海石人墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"小洪纳海石人墓","text":"小洪纳海石人墓，又称草原石人及大土墩、昭苏县种马场石人、小洪那海突厥石人等，是第一突厥汗国时期的石人墓葬，最可能是西突厥汗国可汗泥利可汗的陵园，位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州昭苏县。\n小洪纳海石人是武士形象的红褐色花岗岩圆雕，为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B4%AA%E7%BA%B3%E6%B5%B7%E7%9F%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%A2%93","revisionId":95270822,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95270822","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/17892ca9c1f0f4caaafc6763.jpg","title":"小洪纳海石人墓（正面，东）.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%B0%8F%E6%B4%AA%E7%BA%B3%E6%B5%B7%E7%9F%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%A2%93%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%9C%EF%BC%89.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B4%AA%E7%BA%B3%E6%B5%B7%E7%9F%B3%E4%BA%BA%E5%A2%93%EF%BC%88%E6%AD%A3%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%9C%EF%BC%89.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​小洪纳海石人墓（正面，东）","width":320,"height":213}}